234	  // A step that closes the unit goes to the page's closing card, whichever
235	  // kind it is underneath: a finalizeUnit, or a manual step marked
236	  // closesUnit. Its own confirmation or checklist is the same kind of ask
237	  // as any other and sends it back to the page; empty, it is the one
238	  // press that writes the close, not a step's own carry-on.
239	  if (closesUnit(step)) {
